  "body": "Refs #628\nDirect-PR: small change asked by the PO on 2026-11-17 (one reaction card), no lot of its own\n\n## What and why\nAdds card `C12` \"Lire hors ligne\" after `C10` (PO request, 2026-11-17): ten cards now, `C08` stays retired. Offline reading is not among the proposals classed Non (tri §3.5 and §4.7, checked). `X1` is untouched.\n- `questions.md`: block `C12`, card counts and control section.\n- `cadrage-construction.md`: Cartes row (ten cards, 90 s) and budgets.\n- `questionnaire.json`, Go validation (ten cards) and tests, node test, `concordance_test.go` (the cadrage parser no longer needs the \"à `C10`\" range), `formulaire-spec.md` counts.\n- Order, export, stats and validation read the card list from the JSON: no hardcoded card in the code.\n\n## Time budget: decision taken\nWith `X1` counted, the table was at 6 min 55 s (iPad); one card costs 9 s, so it is now 7 min 5 s for iPad and 5 min 5 s for iPhone, 5 s over each cap. The PO accepted this on 2026-11-17: nothing is cut, and the test of five (UX-12) will measure the real time. `E0` \"5 à 7 minutes\" stays accurate.\n\n## How it was verified\n`go test ./...`, `node --test` (16 pass), markdownlint-cli2@0.18.1 (0 errors). `git diff --cached --stat` checked: no pbxproj, no `Packages/`, no VPS-CONNECTION.md.\n\nAuthor model: Sonnet 5.5. Reviewer requested: a different model (Opus 5.5).\n\n",
